WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.244 --> 00:00:02.744
(light music)

00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:09.856
(ringing)

00:00:09.856 --> 00:00:11.201
- Hi!

00:00:11.201 --> 00:00:12.609
Ah, it's really you.

00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:13.956
- Hi, Bridge.

00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:15.694
- What time is it over there?

00:00:15.694 --> 00:00:17.897
- Oh, I don't know; late.

00:00:17.897 --> 00:00:18.730
- Shit, I'm sorry.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.317
I should have checked.

00:00:20.317 --> 00:00:22.707
- No, I wanted to talk to you.

00:00:22.707 --> 00:00:23.927
So you got there okay?

00:00:23.927 --> 00:00:25.259
- Yeah, I just got to my dorm.

00:00:25.259 --> 00:00:26.092
Look.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:29.122
- Cool.

00:00:29.122 --> 00:00:29.955
- Yeah.

00:00:29.955 --> 00:00:30.953
My roommate's not here yet.

00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:32.247
Oh my god, I'm so nervous.

00:00:32.247 --> 00:00:34.383
I miss you already.

00:00:34.383 --> 00:00:36.447
- Aw, don't worry Bridge.

00:00:36.447 --> 00:00:38.347
Everything's gonna be okay.

00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:40.106
(screeching)

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.606
(light music)

00:00:43.813 --> 00:00:44.886
- The room looks good.

00:00:44.886 --> 00:00:45.763
- Yeah, I know.

00:00:45.763 --> 00:00:47.470
I guess it just needed
some pictures of us.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.305
Oh, my roommate just walked in.

00:00:49.305 --> 00:00:50.614
You can meet her.

00:00:50.614 --> 00:00:52.022
Kelly.

00:00:52.022 --> 00:00:53.324
- Hi, I'm Kelly.

00:00:53.324 --> 00:00:54.564
I've heard a lot about you.

00:00:54.564 --> 00:00:55.397
- Hi!

00:00:55.397 --> 00:00:56.500
Nice to meet you.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.453
Make sure you take care of her.

00:00:59.453 --> 00:01:00.585
- It's just really hard,

00:01:00.585 --> 00:01:01.901
like everyone's already got their friends

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:03.207
and I'm all on my own

00:01:03.207 --> 00:01:04.904
because of the dumb time I transferred.

00:01:04.904 --> 00:01:06.315
- Oh Bridge I'm sorry.

00:01:06.315 --> 00:01:07.526
I wish I was there.

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:09.076
- Yeah, and things aren't like at home.

00:01:09.076 --> 00:01:12.466
Like they call crisps
chips and chips fries

00:01:12.466 --> 00:01:15.114
and what the hell is a
dime compared to a quarter?

00:01:15.114 --> 00:01:17.884
- (Laughing) I wish I
could give you a hug.

00:01:17.884 --> 00:01:20.534
Things will get easier; I swear.

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:23.534
(melancholic music)

00:01:26.145 --> 00:01:28.478
(whooshing)

00:01:36.616 --> 00:01:39.616
(melancholic music)

00:01:41.248 --> 00:01:43.334
- Yeah, so Samantha' gonna
come costume shopping with me

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:44.477
for the 80's party.

00:01:44.477 --> 00:01:45.646
- Who's Samantha?

00:01:45.646 --> 00:01:46.753
- Oh she's just a girl from college.

00:01:46.753 --> 00:01:48.797
She's in Andy's psychology class.

00:01:48.797 --> 00:01:50.390
- Oh cool.

00:01:50.390 --> 00:01:52.377
- Yeah, anyway, so she's gonna get a tutu,

00:01:52.377 --> 00:01:53.821
but I don't think I'm going to

00:01:53.821 --> 00:01:55.496
because I don't really
want to let my leg out

00:01:55.496 --> 00:01:56.529
because it's cold.

00:01:56.529 --> 00:02:00.696
I was gonna get neon tights
and maybe like a skater dress.

00:02:02.835 --> 00:02:03.749
- Hey.

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:05.303
- Oh hey, I met you at that party.

00:02:05.303 --> 00:02:06.776
- Yeah, Madison.

00:02:06.776 --> 00:02:08.916
- I am Bridgette.

00:02:08.916 --> 00:02:10.661
Yeah, that party kind of sucked, right?

00:02:10.661 --> 00:02:13.378
- Yeah, not my favorite.

00:02:13.378 --> 00:02:16.018
- Yeah and she's coming
over in a bit to hang out.

00:02:16.018 --> 00:02:16.939
- Oh that's awesome.

00:02:16.939 --> 00:02:20.547
See I told you you'd make friends.

00:02:20.547 --> 00:02:23.578
(laughing)

00:02:23.578 --> 00:02:25.174
(phone ringing)

00:02:25.174 --> 00:02:26.616
- Oh my god, she's so funny.

00:02:26.616 --> 00:02:28.976
Did you see her SNL episode last year?

00:02:28.976 --> 00:02:29.840
- Yes!

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.126
Oh my god, yeah you're right.
- So good.

00:02:31.126 --> 00:02:32.602
(laughing)

00:02:32.602 --> 00:02:35.352
(birds tweeting)

00:02:39.137 --> 00:02:42.636
(phone ringing)

00:02:42.636 --> 00:02:43.856
- Come on, answer.

00:02:43.856 --> 00:02:45.480
(phone ringing)

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.313
- Answer.

00:02:47.555 --> 00:02:49.684
(phone ringing)

00:02:49.684 --> 00:02:51.706
- I didn't realize you were
in my American Lit class.

00:02:51.706 --> 00:02:55.071
- Yep, I was supposed
to take it as a Freshman

00:02:55.071 --> 00:02:58.488
but just getting (mumbling).

00:02:58.488 --> 00:02:59.781
- I really like Mr. Abrams.

00:02:59.781 --> 00:03:00.614
- Pretty cool.

00:03:00.614 --> 00:03:01.522
- Oh, I have him.

00:03:01.522 --> 00:03:02.355
- Oh really?

00:03:02.355 --> 00:03:04.107
- Yeah, he's actually really good.

00:03:04.107 --> 00:03:06.046
I like him a lot.

00:03:06.046 --> 00:03:07.777
- Hi, where have you been?

00:03:07.777 --> 00:03:09.305
- I just got busy.

00:03:09.305 --> 00:03:10.984
You didn't answer either.

00:03:10.984 --> 00:03:12.889
- Because I got busy too.

00:03:12.889 --> 00:03:15.299
I wanted some advice actually.

00:03:15.299 --> 00:03:17.343
Eric's being a total shithead again.

00:03:17.343 --> 00:03:19.206
I don't know why I stay with him.

00:03:19.206 --> 00:03:22.037
Anyway, Samantha ended up
talking with me about it.

00:03:22.037 --> 00:03:24.613
- Oh, well at least you have Samantha.

00:03:24.613 --> 00:03:27.277
Look, I'm late for class.

00:03:27.277 --> 00:03:28.330
- Okay.

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:29.163
- Okay.

00:03:30.701 --> 00:03:34.191
- [Professor] (indistinct
speech) clearly before us.

00:03:34.191 --> 00:03:35.895
- Are you guys going to
that concert on Saturday?

00:03:35.895 --> 00:03:37.527
- No, my frat's having a party.

00:03:37.527 --> 00:03:38.844
- Oh, boo.

00:03:38.844 --> 00:03:40.414
What about you Bridge?

00:03:40.414 --> 00:03:41.263
Bridgette?

00:03:41.263 --> 00:03:42.096
- What?

00:03:43.284 --> 00:03:47.230
- Yeah, I miss you too, but look at us

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.487
we're all grown up and shit.

00:03:49.487 --> 00:03:52.055
(laughing)

00:03:52.055 --> 00:03:54.399
Yeah, yeah, I'll talk to you later.

00:03:54.399 --> 00:03:55.679
Okay, bye.

00:03:55.679 --> 00:03:58.679
(melancholic music)

00:04:13.714 --> 00:04:16.464
(birds tweeting)

00:04:22.271 --> 00:04:24.854
(upbeat music)

00:04:28.691 --> 00:04:30.185
- Oh, morning.

00:04:30.185 --> 00:04:32.582
- Hey, you want to get
breakfast before class?

00:04:32.582 --> 00:04:33.962
- Yeah, totally.

00:04:33.962 --> 00:04:35.632
Let's do it.

00:04:35.632 --> 00:04:38.215
(upbeat music)

